  "body": "Ground floor apartments and sea views rarely sit in the same sentence. At 1A The Parade, they do!\r\n\r\nSet on an expansive, beautifully usable piece of land, this is a true ground-level residence with genuine connection to the outdoors, not a token patio, but real grounds. Lawn, space, air, and that immediate, effortless flow you simply don’t get in elevated apartments.\r\n\r\nAnd then… the views.\r\n\r\nOpen, calming, blue water views that remind you exactly why you chose the Eastern Bays in the first place. It’s an incredibly rare combination, the ease of ground floor living, without sacrificing outlook or light.\r\n\r\nA real highlight is the direct access to the waterfront - from your living areas, it's just a few steps across your lawn, through your private gate and over to the beach. An easy, every day luxury.\r\n\r\nInside, the home unfolds with quiet confidence. Three genuine bedrooms are well separated, including a master that feels properly resolved – its own ensuite and a walk-in wardrobe that actually works, not an afterthought squeezed into a corner. A second bathroom services the rest of the home with ease, keeping things practical without compromising the overall feel.\r\n\r\nConstructed in concrete tilt slab, this is the type of building buyers consistently ask for and almost never find. Solid, quiet, proven, the kind of construction that holds its own over time and gives a real sense of permanence.\r\n\r\nThe scale is generous, the layout considered, and the living spaces open seamlessly to the outdoors, making this feel far closer to a home than an apartment.\r\n\r\nAdding to the appeal, this is a boutique block of just three residences, with a Body Corporate that is managed internally. It’s simple, efficient, and creates a genuinely friendly, low-friction environment.\r\n\r\nMoments from the waterfront, with St Heliers Village just a short stroll away, the lifestyle here is exactly what you’d expect – easy, coastal, and quietly premium.\r\n\r\nBut it’s the combination that makes this special:\r\n\r\n• Ground level\r\n• Real grounds\r\n• Sea views\r\n• Concrete construction\r\n• Only three in the block\r\n\r\nOpportunities like this don’t circulate often, and when they do, they don’t last.\r\n\r\nSee interactive features for this property on barfoot.co.nz. Click the \"View office website\" link at the bottom of this page.",
